    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061231.0251\n\nBUCHAREST, Dec 31 , 2006, 2006\n\nNew Year rings in EU membership for Bulgaria, Romania\n\n\n\n\nFormer communist states Bulgaria and Romania celebrated Monday joining the European Union, a historic moment that drew thousands to midnight concerts but leaders warned reforms were still needed.\n\nThe addition of the two former Soviet bloc states brought the number of EU nations to 27, with a total population of almost half a billion people.",
